<title>FRANCE: French privatisation cash seen at 27 bln Ffr in 97.</title>
<headline>French privatisation cash seen at 27 bln Ffr in 97.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday he expected French privatisation receipts in 1997 of 27 billion francs.  </p>
<p>&quot;These receipts will come primarily from the placing on the market of France Telecom shares next spring,&quot; Arthuis told a 1997 budget news conference.</p>
<p>He did not elaborate.</p>
</text>
